 Se você ainda não atribuiu &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://help.salesforce.com/articleView?id=sf.mc_co_update_field_level_security.htm&amp;type=5&quot;&gt;Email Opt Out&lt;/a&gt; ou atualizado o &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://help.salesforce.com/articleView?id=sf.mc_co_update_page_layouts.htm&amp;type=5&quot;&gt;Page Layouts&lt;/a&gt;, faça isso agora.
